  "bio": "Robin Groseille is a talented tattoo artist specialized in fineline and floral designs, creating intricate and elegant pieces that effortlessly enhance the skin's natural beauty. Their work demonstrates a high level of cleanliness and attention to detail, ensuring each client's experience is as impeccable as their art. Based in Reims, France, Robin invites clients to contact them directly for information and appointments, exuding professionalism with every interaction.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Reims, Grand Est, France"
